es>Y</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Invasive lobular carcinoma of the male breast</article-title><source>Can J Surg</source><year>2006</year><volume>49</volume><fpage>365</fpage><lpage>366</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17152578</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>